{"id":23,"role":"Tool","content":"Search results (5):\n\n1. [https://projecteuclid.org/journals/communications-in-mathematical-physics/volume-113/issue-3/General-proof-of-Osterwalder-Schrader-positivity-for-the-Wilson-action/cmp/1104160284.pdf]\n   PDF General Proof of Osterwalder-Schrader Positivity for the Wilson Action\n   In this note we shall prove the Osterwalder-Schrader positivity condition for all gauge invariant quantities for any separation in the case of the Wilson action.\n\n2. [https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/0920563288901715]\n   Osterwalder-schrader positivity for the wilson action\n   Abstract Osterwalder-Seiler's proof of reflection positivity of lattice gauge theories with fermions is extended to the case in which the reflection is performed with respect to planes containing sites. Our proof applies to all observables and relies on the particular structure of the Wiklson action.\n\n3. [https://link.springer.com/content/pdf/10.1007/BF01221251.pdf]\n   PDF General proof of Osterwalder-Schrader positivity for the Wilson action\n   Abstract. We extend theproof byOsterwalder and Seiler ofreflection positivity of lattice gauge theories with fermions tthe case inwhich t reflection e is performed with respect toplanes containing sites. Our proof applies toall observables and relies on the particular structure of the Wilson action. This assures the positivity of the correlation functions (O(F)F) for any gauge invariant ...\n\n4. [https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/BF01221251]\n   General proof of Osterwalder-Schrader positivity for the Wilson action ...\n   We extend the proof by Osterwalder and Seiler of reflection positivity of lattice gauge theories with fermions to the case in which the reflection is performed with respect to planes containing sites. Our proof applies to all observables and relies on the particular structure of the Wilson action. This assures the positivity of the correlation functions 〈θ(F)F〉 for any gauge invariant ...\n\n5. [https://projecteuclid.org/journals/communications-in-mathematical-physics/volume-113/issue-3/General-proof-of-Osterwalder-Schrader-positivity-for-the-Wilson-action/cmp/1104160284.short]\n   General proof of Osterwalder-Schrader positivity for the Wilson action\n   1987 General proof of Osterwalder-Schrader positivity for the Wilson action\n\n","timestamp":1783960304,"token_count":580,"tool_call_id":"call_00_RKRyXHSbVwlnSbyik8d94746","full_token_estimate":538,"tool_meta":{"tool_name":"web_search","file_path":null,"old_text":"Menotti Pelissetto Osterwalder-Schrader positivity Wilson action reflection positivity proof simpler","new_text":null,"exit_code":null,"line_count":null,"byte_count":2311,"is_error":false,"duration_ms":1073,"edit_line":null},"turn":9,"is_prune_marker":false}
